        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "12 Colmans Square is a well-presented three-bedroom home with two bathroom, ideally suited to first-time buyers, right-sizers, or anyone seeking a comfortable home in an established residential setting. The property is in good condition throughout and offers excellent potential for modernisation, allowing the next owner to create a stylish and welcoming home tailored to their own taste.\r\nKey Features\r\n•\tThree-bedroom terraced property with two bathroom\r\n•\tApproximate floor area: 80.34 sq m\r\n•\tBER rating: D BER Number 119666253\r\n•\tOil central heating\r\n•\tPrivate rear garden\r\n•\tOn-street parking\r\n•\tHouse is in good condition with scope to modernise\r\n•\tSouth-facing rear aspect\r\nLocation\r\nThe property enjoys a lovely position within a mature and established park, with a communal green area to the front that enhances the sense of space and neighbourhood appeal. A bus stop is located near the entrance to the park, providing convenient access to local transport links and nearby amenities. One is within walking distance of the local schools, shops, train station and amenities. \r\nWith its generous accommodation, attractive rear garden, convenient parking, and strong potential for modern upgrades, 12 Colmans Square represents an excellent opportunity to secure a home in a pleasant, settled location."
      },
